msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Skeniraj model lica"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Nije moguće spremiti model lica"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Skeniraj drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Nije moguće snimiti drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je spremljen, pa prijava licem već radi. Provjerite je "
"li vaše lice dobro osvijetljeno i u sredini kadra pa pokušajte ponovno"
" — ili preskočite i dodajte model kasnije u Postavkama."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Dodaj model lica (obavezno)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Prijava licem zahtijeva barem jedan model lica, pa se ovo skeniranje n"
"e može preskočiti. Snimite ga pri svjetlu u kojem obično sjedite. Osvj"
"etljenje mijenja kako kamera vidi vaše lice, stoga razmislite da kasni"
"je u Postavkama dodate drugi model snimljen pri drugačijem svjetlu (na"
" primjer navečer uz svjetiljke umjesto danjeg svjetla)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Dodaj drugi model lica (preporučeno)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je spremljen. Osvjetljenje mijenja kako kamera vidi vaš"
"e lice: model snimljen pri danjem svjetlu može zakazati navečer uz svj"
"etiljke (ili obrnuto), a Ubuntu Hello tada istekne umjesto da otključa"
". Drugi model snimljen pri drugačijem svjetlu održava prepoznavanje po"
"uzdanim u bilo koje doba dana."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Najprije promijenite osvjetljenje: upalite ili ugasite svjetlo u sobi "
"ili stolnu svjetiljku, okrenite se od prozora ili stavite naočale koje"
" ponekad nosite. Zatim pogledajte ravno u kameru i pritisnite Skeniraj"
"."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Postavljanje Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autenti"
"čnosti lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n\n<b>TPM status:</b> Provjera T"
"PM hardvera i alata..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autenti"
"čnosti lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n\n<b>TPM status:</b> TPM hardve"
"r otkriven. Automatsko instaliranje <i>tpm2-tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autenti"
"čnosti lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n\n<b>TPM status:</b> Hardverski"
" TPM 2.0 aktivan. Vaša lozinka bit će sigurno zapečaćena unutar TPM-a."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autenti"
"čnosti lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n\n<b>TPM status:</b> otkriven j"
"e TPM hardver, ali automatska instalacija <i>tpm2-tools</i> nije uspje"
"la. Pokrenite <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Vraćanje na so"
"ftversko predmemoriranje vjerodajnica."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autenti"
"čnosti lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n\n<b>TPM status:</b> TPM hardve"
"r nije otkriven. Korištenje softverskog predmemoriranja vjerodajnica ("
"AES-256-GCM)."

