#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Postavljanje je gotovo!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Gotovi smo! Ubuntu Hello je sada aktivan na ovom računalu. Pokušajte u"
"činiti bilo što za što biste inače morali upisati lozinku za provjeru "
"autentičnosti, poput pokretanja naredbe sa sudo. Ako ste omogućili aut"
"omatsko otključavanje privjeska za ključeve, vaš privjesak za ključeve"
" ili KWallet također će se automatski otključati prilikom prijave.\n\n"
"Kasnije možete otvoriti Ubuntu Hello konfigurator kako biste promijeni"
"li naprednije postavke ili dodali dodatne modele. Pritisnite Završi is"
"pod kako biste zatvorili ovaj prozor i otvorili Ubuntu Hello konfigura"
"tor."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš privjesak ključeva za prij"
"avu ili KWallet pomoću provjere autentičnosti lica, sprječavajući upit"
"e za lozinku nakon prijave."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Omogući automatsko otključavanje privjeska za ključeve/KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Potvrdite lozinku"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Postavljanje politike sigurnosti"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Zbog promjena u kutovima, udaljenosti i drugim čimbenicima podudaranje"
" lica nikada nije točno isto kao i pohranjeni model lica. Na ovoj stra"
"nici možete odrediti koliko bi Ubuntu Hello trebao biti strog."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Brzo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Omogućuje više nejasnih podudaranja, \nali uvelike ubrzava proces sken"
"iranja."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Uravnotežen"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Još uvijek relativno brzo otkrivanje, \nali možda se nećete prijaviti "
"kada budete dalje."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Siguran"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Malo sigurnija opcija, \nali bit će potrebno puno više vremena da vas "
"provjeri autentičnost"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Dodavanje modela lica"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi vas autentificirao, Ubuntu Hello mora spremiti model vašeg lic"
"a kako bi vas prepoznao. Pritisnite gumb Skeniraj ispod kako biste zap"
"očeli skeniranje lica."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Preskoči za sada"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Više modela lica možete dodati kasnije u Postavkama ili naredbom: sudo"
" ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Konfiguriranje web kamere"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Treperi li infracrveni emiter?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "Da"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "Ne"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello će automatski pretražiti vaš sustav za sve dostupne kamer"
"e, stoga provjerite je li vaša web kamera povezana. Nakon otkrivanja p"
"rikazat će se popis upotrebljivih web kamera. Odaberite onu koju želit"
"e koristiti i kliknite Dalje."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Testiranje vaših web kamera, pričekajte..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Preuzimanje podatkovnih datoteka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello treba tri unaprijed obučena skupa podataka za prepoznavan"
"je lica kako bi vas mogao prepoznati, a koji će se sada preuzeti. Tije"
"k preuzimanja možete vidjeti u nastavku."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Početak preuzimanja..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli u Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verzija"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj čarobnjak će vas provesti kroz proces postavljanja i automatski k"
"onfigurirati Ubuntu Hello za vas. Pritisnite Dalje za nastavak."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Otkazati"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Sljedeći"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Završi postavljanje"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Windows Hello provjera autentičnosti lica"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "lice;prepoznavanje;provjera autentičnosti;sigurnost;zaključavanje;"
